{"unit_id":"antibrow__dsh-antibrow#card-zh","repo":"antibrow/dsh-antibrow","commit":"d032210ba3f5747686fb151fc79d2bc9a89c2ea4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-antibrow 是一个面向 DSH 的浏览器工具接入插件，通过 Cordis patch 注册 MCP 客户端，并以 stdio 启动 anti-detect-browser CLI。Harness 可通过该客户端发现外部服务提供的浏览器工具；本仓库负责连接配置、版本参数和密钥环境变量传递，不包含浏览器引擎或工具实现。它适合希望在 DSH 工作流中调用该 MCP 浏览器服务的用户。安装后需要配置 ANTI_DETECT_BROWSER_KEY，并确保运行环境可用 DSH 与 npx。仓库还提供开发覆盖配置，可将启动命令改为本地 SDK CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-21","cordis.patch.local.yml:8-17"]}
{"unit_id":"antibrow__dsh-antibrow#card-en","repo":"antibrow/dsh-antibrow","commit":"d032210ba3f5747686fb151fc79d2bc9a89c2ea4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-antibrow connects AntiBrow's browser MCP server to DeepSeek Harness. Its Cordis patch runs anti-detect-browser over stdio and passes ANTI_DETECT_BROWSER_KEY, letting DSH discover its tools. Install with the DSH plugin command; runtime needs npx and a configured key.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-21","cordis.patch.local.yml:8-17"]}
